@startuml
actor Admin
participant FE
participant ReportSvc
database DB


Admin -> FE : Mở "Báo cáo & Thống kê"
FE -> ReportSvc : listReportTypes()
ReportSvc --> FE : types
Admin -> FE : Chọn tiêu chí/time range
FE -> ReportSvc : runStats(filters)
ReportSvc -> DB : aggregate by dimension(s)
DB --> ReportSvc : results
ReportSvc --> FE : charts/tables
opt Export
FE -> ReportSvc : exportReport(type)
ReportSvc --> FE : file link
end
@enduml